      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The coins total \\(1 + 5 + 10 + 25 = 41\\) cents.\n\nSince one dollar is \\(100\\) cents, this is \\(41\\%\\) of a dollar.\n\nThus, the correct answer is D .",
